## SIGNAL FLOW

```text
[ADC IN] ──> [INPUT GAIN] ──┬──> [LF] ──> [LMF] ──> [HMF] ──> [HF] ──> [WET GAIN] ──┐
                            │                                                       ├──> [OUTPUT GAIN] ──> [DAC OUT]
                            └────────────────────────────────────────> [DRY GAIN] ──┘
```

